    "topic": "kql2-body-input-projection-dependency-trap-20260921",
    "content": "An attempted optimization resolved only SourceExecutor._inputs roles into the BODY evaluation environment. It caused 109 missing-positive semantic regressions (input conversion adapters, static policy, queued commands and batch work). Removing only the projection made all 109 pass again. Root cause seen in BodyEngine.match/member_place: literal member matching builds declared IDs from all current.values() Nodes whose name matches expected.value, so it reads roles not explicitly named in AST expressions; Clause.name also carries role references. The memo-key subset is not a proven full dependency contract; audit memo key correctness separately before reusing it for environment pruning. Preserve full BODY environment until compiler/runtime expose complete dependencies.",
